# Brands collected in v1 (ADR-0004). One per line; '#' starts a comment.
#
# Entries are matched against the CDR register by NAME, case- and
# punctuation-insensitively, then by unique whole-word substring. A brand id
# (UUID) also works and wins over any name, for when a name is ambiguous.
#
# Every entry is reported when you run discover:
#     ok        Macquarie Bank  ->  Macquarie Bank Limited
#     AMBIGUOUS Bank of Queensland  ->  3 brands, none enabled
#     NO MATCH  Up
#
# Nothing is guessed at: an ambiguous or unmatched entry is skipped and named,
# because quietly collecting 17 banks when you asked for 20 is the failure that
# ruins the dataset months later.
#
# To find an exact name:  rateradar discover --grep macquarie
# To widen coverage:      add lines here, then rateradar discover --apply

# --- the four majors -------------------------------------------------------
Commonwealth Bank
Westpac
ANZ
National Australia Bank

# --- brands the majors run separately (own products, own rate decisions) ----
Bankwest                  # CBA
St George Bank            # Westpac
Bank of Melbourne         # Westpac
BankSA                    # Westpac
ubank                     # NAB

# --- the next tier ---------------------------------------------------------
Macquarie Bank
ING
Bendigo Bank
Bank of Queensland
ME Bank                   # BOQ
Virgin Money              # BOQ
Suncorp Bank              # ANZ-owned, still priced separately
AMP Bank
HSBC
Great Southern Bank
Judo Bank                 # term deposit specialist: moves often

